Gve5RVBu05uSqFJsnWYjJ6oE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM3lafHbigz_uzJ7IeB-64j880NLAEZIcEOTEMa0MRQOw&oe=6ACA4A45"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Spatial Film", "keywords": ["VR180", "360", "3D", "3D360", "Movies"], "long_description": "Spatial Film turns your Meta Quest into a personal immersive cinema - streaming cinematic VR180 and 3D films that surround you with breathtaking places, live performances, and moments captured in true stereoscopic depth.\n\nSHOT ON PROFESSIONAL CINEMA GEAR\nOur original films are captured on the Blackmagic URSA Cine Immersive - a professional immersive cinema camera - in 16K HDR, then expertly super-sampled and mastered for Meta Quest. The result is razor-sharp detail, deep dynamic range, and lifelike depth that sets a new bar for immersive video on the platform.\n\nWHAT'S INCLUDED\n\u2022 A curated, always-growing catalog of original cinematic VR films\n\u2022 Immersive 360\u00b0 photo environments to relax and explore\n\u2022 Play your own VR180, 3D, and 360 videos straight from your headset\n\u2022 Stream your personal library over Wi-Fi from your computer with our free companion app\n\nSPATIAL FILM+\nSubscribe to unlock the complete Originals catalog. Start with a 7-day free trial, then $3.99/month or $29.99/year. A selection of films is always free \u2014 no subscription required.\n\nQuestions? Visit: https://spatial.film/", "short_description": "Turn your Meta Quest into a personal immersive cinema. Spatial Film streams cinematic VR180 and 3D films that surround you with breathtaking places, live performances, and stories in true stereoscopic depth. Explore a growing catalog of originals, relax in 360\u00b0 photo environments, and play your own VR videos. Subscribe to Spatial Film+ for the full library or enjoy free films anytime."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://spatial.film/metaquest/privacy/", "developer_terms